{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"规范理论"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“规范理论”"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>在经典电动力学中, 规范对称性是通过电磁势来体现的.</p>\n<p>规范原理 (gauge principle) 是 Hermann Weyl 1928 年的伟大发现.</p>\n<h2>量子力学</h2>\n"}}